          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ugira icumi na rimwe, mu kwezi kwa gatatu, ku musi wakwo wa mbere umwami Yehoyakini ari mu kinyago, ijambo ry’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ryatumwe kuri jewe riti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana w’umuntu, barira Farawo umwami wa Egiputa n’isinzi ry’abantu biwe uti:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None rero uku ni ko jewe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Nyeninganji mvuze: Ko ryaduze hejuru cane, rigashitsa agasunwa hejuru y’ibicu, rikishimira uburebure bwaryo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "narirekuriye mu maboko y’uwuganza amahanga ngo aryishure ibihwanye n’ivyaha vyaryo. Jewe ubwanje nararyirukanye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ingabo ziteye ubwoba z’abanyamahanga ziraryiciye, zisiga riryamye hasi. Amashami yaryo agwa ku misozi no mu biyaya, ayandi avunagurikira ku migende y’amazi yose yo mu gihugu. Amahanga yose yari mu gitutu caryo avayo aragenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibisiga vyo mu kirere biraza biba ku mutumba waryo uryamye hasi, n’inyamaswa zo mw’ishamba ziraza zibera mu mashami yaco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co gituma ata giti co hafi y’amazi kizokwirata uburebure bwaco, canke ngo kiduze agasunwa kaco gushika hejuru y’ibicu. Nta n’ibikomeye vyo muri vyo bivomerewe neza bizoshikira ubwo burebure, kuko vyose bigenewe gupfa bikaja i kuzimu, co kimwe n’abamanuka baja mu rwobo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uku ni ko jewe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Nyeninganji mvuze: Ku musi Ashuri yamanuwe ajanwa mu mva, iwabo w’abapfuye, amariba nayapfukishije ukumugandarira; nahagaritse imigende yaho, n’amazi menshi ndayagomera. Kubera we, nambitse Libani umwijima, n’ibiti vyo mw’ishamba vyose birakabirana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natumye amahanga ahinda agashitsi yumvise ukugwa kwiwe, igihe namumanura mu mva, iwabo w’abapfuye ngo aje kubana n’abamanutse bakaja mu rwobo. Maze ibiti vyose vyo muri Edeni, ivyiza kurusha ibindi vyose vyo muri Libani, ibiti imizi yavyo ishorera mu mazi, vyarahumurijwe no kumusanga i bwina mu kuzimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na vyo nyene, co kimwe n’amasederi, vyaragiye iwabo w’abapfuye, aho abishwe n’inkota bari, aho bari kumwe n’abagabo bari bafise ibigwanisho, bakibera mu gitutu ciwe mu mahanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
